{"codec":"JSON-syntax-dictionary-v4","atoms":["\"schema\"","\"identity\"","\"framework\"","\"exclusions\"","\"factors\"","\"scores\"","\"market\"","\"historical\"","\"model_rows\"","\"reverse_roots\"","\"capacity_rows\"","\"all_paths_file\"","\"all_paths_sha256\"","\"path_count\"","\"path_index_file\"","\"source_register_file\"","\"evidence_ledger_file\"","\"report_file\"","\"input_hashes\"","\"generated_hashes\"","\"small-micro-cap-v3-canonical-rajputana-industries-1\"","\"issuer\"","\"symbol\"","\"isin\"","\"cohort\"","\"exchange\"","\"price\"","\"price_date\"","\"cutoff\"","\"timezone\"","\"shares\"","\"lot\"","\"entry_date\"","\"exit_date\"","\"Rajputana Industries Limited\"","\"RAJINDLTD\"","\"INE0PCU01012\"","\"SME\"","\"NSE Emerge\"","\"61\"","\"2026-10-19\"","\"2026-10-20\"","\"Asia/Kolkata\"","22215000","1500","\"2031-10-19\"","\"title\"","\"filename\"","\"sha256\"","\"bytes\"","\"version\"","\"read_actual_document\"","\"required_sections\"","\"canonical_factors\"","\"gates\"","\"Small / Micro-Cap Stock Research Master Prompt v3.0\"","\"Small-Micro-Cap-Stock-Research-Master-Prompt-v3.0.md\"","\"68d4de4255427df276318d0231530b867a453e740c74150e9768bf1387224137\"","72939","\"3.0\"","true","15","13","4","\"Post-cutoff filings not used\"","\"Rajputana Biodiesel and Rajputana Stainless are different issuers\"","\"Group cash/rating scope never substitutes for standalone issuer cash\"","\"Private source PDFs/OCR and transfer helpers excluded from deliverables\"","\"GOV\"","\"MOAT\"","\"REV\"","\"DUR\"","\"CAP\"","\"CASH\"","\"BAL\"","\"EXEC\"","\"EARN\"","\"R\"","\"D\"","\"P\"","\"L\"","3","null","5","2","7","1","\"BQS\"","\"GQS\"","\"IAS\"","\"classification\"","\"uncertainty\"","\"score\"","\"confidence\"","\"evidence\"","\"basis\"","\"contrary\"","\"Medium\"","\"A10\"","\"A11\"","\"Large related sales and unseasoned related LLP allocation constrain minority stewardship.\"","\"A01/A04 unmodified audits, outgoing-auditor no-issue statement and disclosed RPTs oppose integrity-fail inference.\"","\"A15\"","\"A20\"","\"Commodity conversion, price competition and concentrated group demand show weak barriers.\"","\"A13 physical scaling and process integration are useful but not demonstrated durable excess returns.\"","\"Low\"","\"A13\"","\"A14\"","\"Nominal CAGR and aggregate output cannot establish like-for-like external physical demand throughFY26; no invented middle score.\"","\"A13 FY23–25 tonnes confirm real expansion; nominal results are not dismissed, but exact price/mix/scope bridge missing.\"","\"Electrical metal/alloy end markets and expanded certified capacity give accessible room, tempered by customer concentration.\"","\"A15 uncontracted inventory and low switching costs make nameplate capacity insufficient evidence of demand.\"","\"A12\"","\"A18\"","\"Committed-capital proxies include CWIP, rising ONWC and funding; observed 3-year incremental return~8.5% below12–16% analytical WACC range.\"","\"A14 new commissioning can have a lag; marginal economics may improve but no project cash IRR or order-linked returns disclosed.\"","\"High\"","\"A05\"","\"A09\"","\"Two-year adjusted CFO−47.6527 versus positivePAT20.5011, before cash financing interest; repeated inventory absorption.\"","\"A05 reportedFY26CFO positive and revenue scaled, but supplier-finance growth explains the apparent conversion.\"","\"A06\"","\"A07\"","\"Adjusted financing~111.96cr, short maturities and revocable rather than committed headroom limit resilience.\"","\"A16 ratings and no reported default support access, but group cash and facilities cannot prove issuer survival.\"","\"Volume/capacity increased but cable/alloy project delayed and new capacity economics unseasoned.\"","\"A13 FY25 output rise is real evidence against a blanket poor-execution label.\"","\"A21\"","\"PAT and operating EBIT growth mostly operating, low other income; postIPO unchanged issued shares allow strongFY26 per-share progress.\"","\"A12 margin/utilization recovery on old assets is not proof of persistent new-project profit; FY25 dilution diluted earlier owners.\"","\"No verified entry cash/funding bridge; uncommitted conditional bull is not a probability-weighted base shareholder return.\"","\"A21 operating profit momentum offers upside if funding and returns are independently established.\"","\"Linked metal valuation/collection/refinancing stress exhausts bounded rescue; secured creditors precede ordinary equity.\"","\"A01 no current default reported, inventory sale proceeds can mitigate losses but recovery haircut unknown.\"","\"Funded positive-skew setup cannot be established; no arbitrary probability weights or cheap-P/E substitute.\"","\"A14 capacity growth could create upside under independently verified cash economics.\"","\"A22\"","\"INR5lakh requires31.196 sessions at5% conservative turnover, with eight zero sessions.\"","\"A22 shares traded52of60 sessions and a market maker exists; neither guarantees spread or exit liquidity.\"","\"weights\"","\"contributions\"","\"known_sum\"","\"missing_weight\"","\"coverage\"","\"raw\"","\"raw_display\"","\"bound\"","\"cap\"","\"post_cap_bound\"","\"final\"","\"final_display\"","\".20\"","\".12\"","\".10\"","\".08\"","\"0.80\"","\"0.60\"","\"0.50\"","\"0.36\"","\"0.20\"","\"0.24\"","\"0.40\"","\"3.10\"","\"0.12\"","\"0.88\"","\"NS\"","\"3.22\"","\"4.30\"","\".40\"","\".15\"","\"1.00\"","\"1.05\"","\"0.45\"","\"2.70\"","\"6.70\"","\"5\"","\".25\"","\".35\"","\"0.10\"","\"0.70\"","\"0.30\"","\"1.20\"","\"7.50\"","\"gate\"","\"status\"","\"reason\"","\"G1 Integrity\"","\"Conditional pass\"","\"No evidenced fraud/diversion/default; material related-party stewardship questions need terms and confirmation follow-up.\"","\"G2 Reliability\"","\"Conditional\"","\"Full audits unmodified; historical classification differences, pending confirmations and external demand bridge constrain selected factors, not wholesale audited P&L usability.\"","\"G3 Funding\"","\"Hold / unresolved\"","\"Entry liquidity and committed refinancing unverified. Counterfactual cash breaches do not establish an actual default. No fail cap mechanically applied.\"","\"G4 Tradability\"","\"Hold / restricted sizing\"","\"L1 measured liquidity, live spread and current restrictions unverified. Price is observable, execution is not assumed.\"","\"Unranked / funding-and-execution hold; not a compounder; cyclical conversion-capacity thesis only\"","\"factor\"","\"delta\"","-1","\"2.90\"","\"3.02\"","\"4.10\"","\"3.30\"","\"3.42\"","\"4.50\"","\"2.98\"","\"4.18\"","\"2.55\"","\"2.95\"","\"6.55\"","\"0.48\"","\"3.34\"","\"4.42\"","\"2.85\"","\"3.25\"","\"6.85\"","\"sessions\"","\"trading_sessions\"","\"mean_value\"","\"median_value\"","\"conservative_value\"","\"last20_mean\"","\"last20_median\"","\"absent60\"","\"absent20\"","\"liquidation_days\"","\"one_lot_cost\"","\"whole_lots_under_reference\"","\"market_cap\"","\"adjusted_enterprise_value_March_anchor\"","\"PE_FY26\"","\"PE_TTM\"","\"EV_EBITDA_FY26\"","\"EV_EBITDA_TTM\"","\"PB\"","\"net_financing_EBITDA\"","\"date_mismatch\"","\"spread\"","\"restrictions\"","60","52","\"507317.50\"","\"320550.00\"","\"232102.50\"","\"191287.50\"","8","\".02\"","\".05\"","\"77.990953049446264233348931523943\"","\"31.196381219778505693339572609577\"","\"15.598190609889252846669786304789\"","\"91500\"","\"135.5115\"","\"247.3884\"","\"11.078441792020928711576193590582\"","\"10.315961358394043894306529335191\"","\"8.8657284465612333759797017621193\"","\"8.1274298836678307549271158098079\"","\"1.7730423609948082398258248199632\"","\"4.0093642824121359379871630847301\"","\"October market / March balance sheet; diagnostic not current EV\"","\"ND; static field not observed bid-ask\"","\"Current surveillance status and observed bid-ask ND. Dated SM series and range do not prove clearance.\"","\"annual\"","\"revenue_cagrs\"","\"incremental_returns\"","\"five_year_incremental_ROIC\"","\"TTM_to_June2026\"","\"cash_conversion\"","\"quantity\"","\"year\"","\"revenue\"","\